@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Statechart · UC07–UC08 Close cycle and release film
skinparam Padding 0
skinparam ranksep 22
skinparam nodesep 24
state "Collecting\nstatus = collecting" as C
state "Revealing / unpublished\nstatus = revealing\nrelease_status = unpublished" as U
state "Revealing / published\nstatus = revealing\nrelease_status = published" as P
state "Archived\nstatus = archived" as A
[*] --> C : createRealGroup()
C -right-> U : advance [now >= ends_at]\n/ ensureCompilationJob(); ensureSuccessor()
U -down-> P : publish [ready proof AND now >= ends_at]\n/ release_published_at := now
P -left-> A : advance [24 h since publication AND ready proof]\n/ addEvent()
C -[hidden]down-> A
legend bottom
advance = advanceCycleLifecycleWithStore(); publish = publishCycleReleaseWithStore().
Ready proof = verified film bytes + unchanged ready job. Failed guards retain the state.
Intake closes at ends_at via cyclePhase(). The successor collects during release.
endlegend
@enduml
